{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4c76f92d9d70d9e38113a689f3277a515eec19546406f0fe11c98c0432d4d165", "ja": "（エミリーと静香が出演した、女児向け特撮ドラマの\nキャラクターショーが、まもなく始まる……）", "zh": "（艾米莉和静香出演的、面向女孩子的特摄电视剧角色秀马上就要开始了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "8c9cb3c9ae0f0f4d5870af38a89ed39a71614cc83e4b28780c3c806d80e46376", "ja": "静香さん、客席はご覧になりましたか？\n女の子たちがたくさん来てくれていましたよ！", "zh": "静香小姐，您看到观众席了吗？\n有好多女孩子来看我们呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "fda1922bbeb46493135204360fdeb338c12f2a0d9ad0fd6d18e68940fa77ec63", "ja": "ええ、まさかこんなに集まってくれるなんて……。\n台詞もポーズも、絶対に間違えられないわね！", "zh": "是啊，没想到竟然会有这么多人聚集过来……\n无论是台词还是动作，都绝对不能出错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "13a8e6b58ed2165814ed2681415484255f444334b188253ab09636f77bad56f6", "ja": "はい！　みなさんの期待を裏切らないように\n最善を尽くしましょう……！", "zh": "好的！为了不辜负大家的期待，我们一起竭尽全力吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b905503b23d7a99fe063b8635d1b80175f1f90d4ea64641d9522b301047b7ccd", "ja": "ふたりとも、気合い十分だな！\nでももう少し気楽に臨んでもいいと思うけど。", "zh": "你们两个都干劲十足啊！\n不过，我觉得也可以更放松一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "c527f60e2e1856dcfc69b5607348d970175f029591cb318c7585b591756d2c18", "ja": "そういうわけにはいきません。子どもたちは、\nこのショーを楽しみにしてるんですよ？", "zh": "不能那样。孩子们可是一直期待着这场演出呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "9ac0b98dd7ef6f3cc541f59bcdbe02e8621de6b0d9acf20e0a7adc3060cb72bb", "ja": "私たちが、夢を壊すようなことはできません。\n制作発表の時のような失敗はしたくありませんから。", "zh": "我们不能做破坏梦想的事。\n因为我不想再犯制作发布会那次那样的失误了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "a4447759203fa5ed48220a28d7fa14bf308c9d33ac9c46c37f752d8db1a53bad", "ja": "静香さん……。わかりました！\nでは本番までに、もう一度練習をしませんか？", "zh": "静香小姐……明白了！\n那么，在正式演出前，我们再练习一次吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "66483986afadfcc82642b2a98fb324d3088b57d4f5e497dbfeafb890e582515e", "ja": "練習した分だけ、自信になると言いますし！\nええと……舞台に行って、立ち位置の確認を……！", "zh": "都说练习多少就能积累多少自信嘛！\n那个……去舞台确认一下站位……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "40db1bc2ceaa0b0ebe06f6b0f4c52b7fac5daf59184051257159b7b35936f4ff", "ja": "ちょっと待ってくれ、エミリー。\n客入りが始まってるからステージには出られないぞ。", "zh": "等等，艾米莉。观众已经开始进场了，现在不能上台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "4df875254440aabba792cb02ac4f2b32d61aa5edc2b59a3d276f9ef558d3f9ba", "ja": "そ、そうでした！　それでは、台本の読み合わせを……\nって、本番まで時間がありませんよね……ううっ。", "zh": "对、对哦！那我们来对一下台本……\n可是，离正式演出已经没时间了吧……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "fa3222b795f554245aba1af83d79bf25473794d945ff32000612e3b34582283b", "ja": "エミリー……。……それなら協力技の練習を\nしてみない？　ふたりの息を合わせるとこでしょう？", "zh": "艾米莉……。……既然这样，要不要练习一下合作技？\n不是要配合好两个人的节奏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "73d2cb0ced20eef178df044b8b511df8fc0ffaea42161b2d32a7456e913f1245", "ja": "協力技……この舞台で一番大事な場面ですね！\nわかりました。それでは練習を始めましょう！", "zh": "合作技……就是这场舞台上最重要的环节吧！\n明白了。那么，我们开始练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "1665dd6bac8ceeac9a2607e9c0cc9bb8cc3337387f3eeed86ac8549fd1882f23", "ja": "あなた方の行いはすべてお見通しです。\nこれ以上の悪事は、私たちが許しません！", "zh": "你们的所作所为我们全都看在眼里。\n我们绝不容许你们再继续作恶了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "e6f64daaaf6f9d725838cf2ee0cef97a5f61727ab40e5cd0c743d2617526e99e", "ja": "子どもたちの平和は、私たちが守るんだから！\nみーんな覚悟しなさいっ！　行くよ、ムーン！", "zh": "孩子们的和平，由我们来守护！\n大家全都做好觉悟吧！上吧，Moon！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "0c4755c1afc74c471813bfa5c9f7ee8370a2d496bf3f4980510ff2a861442311", "ja": "太陽と月の名に懸けて……！\nサン☆ムーン・マジカルアターック！", "zh": "以太阳与月亮之名……！\n太阳☆月亮·魔法攻击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "0c4755c1afc74c471813bfa5c9f7ee8370a2d496bf3f4980510ff2a861442311", "ja": "太陽と月の名に懸けて……！\nサン☆ムーン・マジカルアターック！", "zh": "以太阳与月亮之名……！\n太阳☆月亮·魔法攻击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f72b835551c9fefe778fdaa6db70602da5c0da5b30bb0e2bdffa624a5be851ad", "ja": "うわぁぁぁぁぁ！\n……うん。ふたりとも、バッチリじゃないか！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！\n……嗯。你们两个，不是配合得很完美嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "dbe8a359260db35d6341a3caa034d80b7bdb1b2ff7a15a319f09bdefd5dbae8e", "ja": "はい。なんだか、不安も吹き飛んじゃいました。\nふふっ、練習してよかったわね、エミリー。", "zh": "是的。不知不觉间，连不安也都烟消云散了。\n呵呵，幸好练习过了呢，艾米莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "718b4f7d6857f56e6be904f965bf7d008b4ab0271d4fe908c269bb194d4a6cd9", "ja": "はい！　練習のおかげで、本番も頑張れそうです♪\n協力技は、やはり素晴らしいものですね！　ふふっ。", "zh": "是的！多亏了练习，正式演出时我也能努力发挥了♪\n\n合作技果然是非常棒的东西呢！呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0374_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a9c791d98b2725b39137bdbfe389cd2bd72b3a129c41b1f376aac83897691838", "ja": "（ふたりとも、なんとかリラックスできたみたいだな。\nこの調子なら、本番も期待できそうだ！）", "zh": "（两个人似乎总算放松下来了。\n照这个状态看来，正式演出也很值得期待了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
